"Jacob, a young Avowed from intake, fled Anesidora at night by cruiser in rough weather."
"He joined Superhumans at Large, contributing the Submerger he got from Orpheus Velra."
"He was the youngest aboard, with a potion thief, an older man, a girl of nineteen and a captain."
"Maricel Alcantara refused to go with him and reported it; the SkySea Guard was called."
